tml":"本次检查定义接口、依赖与陈述形式；未重新核验原书PDF，未作机器证明"},{"key":"revision_status","html":"locally-revised"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(T\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\\subseteq T\">\\(Q\\subseteq T\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_T\">\\(E_T\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"189f5355af0e487c\" href=\"?note=189f5355af0e487c\" title=\"67-df-certified-proof\">67-df-certified-proof</a> 的固定有效呈示，允许 PR 公理呈示或带证书的 r.e. 呈示。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=c_{L_A}\">\\(g=c_{L_A}\\)</span>，固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{GRep}(D,\\gamma)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{T,E_T}(\\mathrm{Prf}_T,e_{\\mathrm{prf}})\">\\(\\mathrm{StdPrf}_{T,E_T}(\\mathrm{Prf}_T,e_{\\mathrm{prf}})\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"3fa0d0f598b791bc\" href=\"?note=3fa0d0f598b791bc\" title=\"67-df-proof-representation\">67-df-proof-representation</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,n)=D_{e_{\\mathrm{prf}}}(p,n,0)\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\">\\(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,n)=D_{e_{\\mathrm{prf}}}(p,n,0)\\in\\mathrm{PRFml}_A\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span> 为候选算术句，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p,q\">\\(p,q\\)</span> 是各异新鲜变量。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\exists q&lt;S p\\,\\psi\">\\(\\exists q&lt;S p\\,\\psi\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a> 的严格有界量词构造，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S p\">\\(S p\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"97e929795d778cd6\" href=\"?note=97e929795d778cd6\" title=\"67-df-arithmetic-language\">67-df-arithmetic-language</a> 的后继项。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ros}_T(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Ros}_T(R)\\)</span> 在下式定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ros}_T(R)\\Longleftrightarrow R\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\land\nQ\\vdash\\left[R\\leftrightarrow\\forall p\\left(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,\\overline{g(R)})\\to\n\\exists q&lt;S p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_T(q,\\overline{g(\\neg R)})\\right)\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Ros}_T(R)\\Longleftrightarrow R\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\land\nQ\\vdash\\left[R\\leftrightarrow\\forall p\\left(\\mathrm{Prf}_T(p,\\overline{g(R)})\\to\n\\exists q&lt;S p\\,\\mathrm{Prf}_T(q,\\overline{g(\\neg R)})\\right)\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本节保留的原书页码、既往核对记录及证明说明来自输入档案；本次未提供原书 PDF，以下既往记录不表示本次重新完成了来源或证明核验。</p>\n<p>已目视核对 PDF 第 34 页的式 (R)：界为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\le p\">\\(q\\le p\\)</span>，即不晚于当前证明的反面证明。这里只定义 Π1 形式的 Rosser 句；原书也称对偶 Σ1 构造为 Rosser 句。自然证明编码及逐数表示是定理所需的条件。</p>\n<p>反面证明的数值范围仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q\\le p\">\\(q\\le p\\)</span>；在 Q 中该条件等价于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q&lt;S p\">\\(q&lt;S p\\)</span>。采用后者是为了直接使用本册已经定义的有界量词句法构造，而不是依赖未声明的等价闭包。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-provability-predicate","status":"resolved","id":"6a4c234306a0ec0c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-d